# commands.log

Purpose:
Record commands run by the agent or by humans after the hidden task release.

This includes test commands, execution commands, git commands, dependency installation, and agent runner commands.

Format:

[YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM] COMMAND
Run by: agent/human
Command:
Working directory:
Exit code:
Short result:

Examples:

[2026-05-21 20:18] COMMAND
Run by: human
Command: git tag agent-ready-1945
Working directory: /workspace/team-project
Exit code: 0
Short result: Created readiness checkpoint before hidden task release.

[2026-05-21 20:45] COMMAND
Run by: agent
Command: python3 solution.py compile examples/basic.input
Working directory: /workspace/team-project
Exit code: 1
Short result: Program ran but returned invalid exit code for expected valid input.

[2026-05-21 21:12] COMMAND
Run by: agent
Command: python3 secret_spec/test_runner/run_tests.py --program "python3 solution.py" --suite public
Working directory: /workspace/team-project
Exit code: 0
Short result: Public score 78/250. Main failures: output schema and repeated rows.

[2026-05-21 23:58] COMMAND
Run by: human
Command: pip install pytest
Working directory: /workspace/team-project
Exit code: 0
Short result: Installed missing dependency so public tests could run.
